\par  - Ti\u7873\'3fn g\u7917\'3fi, ti\u7873\'3fn m\u7863\'3ft, c\'e1c gi\u7845\'3fy t\u7901\'3f c\'f3 gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f nh\'fd ti\u7873\'3fn
