nh khung gi\'e1 c\'e1c lo\u7841\'3fi \'f0\u7845\'3ft" \'f0\u7875\'3f t\'ednh thu\u7871\'3f chuy\u7875\'3fn quy\u7873\'3fn s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng \'f0\u7845\'3ft khi giao \'f0\u7845\'3ft, thu ti\u7873\'3fn khi giao \'f0\u7845\'3ft, cho thu\'ea \'f0
\u7845\'3ft, t\'ednh gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn khi giao \'f0\u7845\'3ft, b\u7891\'3fi th\'fd\u7901\'3fng thi\u7879\'3ft h\u7841\'3fi v\u7873\'3f \'f0\u7845\'3ft khi thu h\u7891\'3fi.
\par c/ Ph\'fd\'f5ng ph\'e1p ki\u7875\'3fm k\'ea
\par - Tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc khi ki\u7875\'3fm k\'ea ph\u7843\'3fi ghi s\u7893\'3f k\u7871\'3f to\'e1n \'f0\u7847\'3fy \'f0\u7911\'3f c\'e1c  ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng ph\'e1t sinh \'f0\u7871\'3fn ng\'e0y 15/10/1994 v\'e0 ph\u7843\'3fi kho\'e1 s\u7893\'3f k
\u7871\'3f to\'e1n, x\'e1c \'f0\u7883\'3fnh s\u7889\'3f l\'fd\u7907\'3fng, gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f t\u7915\'3fng t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn, t\u7915\'3fng lo\u7841\'3fi v\u7889\'3fn, qu-'fc b\u7857\'3fng ti\u7873\'3fn hi\u7879\'3fn c\'f3 ghi tr\'ean s\u7893\'3f s
