\'3fng b\u7857\'3fng ph\'fd\'f5ng ph\'e1p chuy\'ean gia.
\par - \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi v\u7889\'3fn b\u7857\'3fng ti\u7873\'3fn ph\u7843\'3fi ki\u7875\'3fm k\'ea t\u7915\'3fng lo\u7841\'3fi v\u7889\'3fn, qu-'fc, t\u7915\'3fng lo\u7841\'3fi ti\u7873\'3fn v\'e0 l\u7853\'3fp b\u7843\'3fng k\'ea ri\'eang (k\u7875
\'3f c\u7843\'3f ngo\u7841\'3fi t\u7879\'3f)
