\'f3 x\'e1c nh\u7853\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa Kho b\u7841\'3fc, Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng, ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi vay, ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi nh\u7853\'3fn t\u7841\'3fm \u7913\'3fng.
\par - C\'e1c lo\u7841\'3fi gi\u7845\'3fy t\u7901\'3f c\'f3 gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f nh\'fd ti\u7873\'3fn ph\u7843\'3fi ki\u7875\'3fm k\'ea nh\'fd ti\u7873\'3fn m\u7863\'3ft. K\u7871\'3ft qu\u7843\'3f ki\u7875\'3fm k\'ea ph\u7843\'3fi \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc ghi v\'e0
o phi\u7871\'3fu ki\u7875\'3fm k\'ea (ho\u7863\'3fc bi\'ean b\u7843\'3fn ki\u7875\'3fm k\'ea) v\'e0 ph\u7843\'3fi \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc c\'e1c th\'e0nh vi\'ean t\u7893\'3f ki\u7875\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40 \ltrch\fcs0 
